Original commit body from 57fd50b:

Git push options (-o description=) cannot contain newline characters.
The previous fix escaped newlines to \n, but Forgejo stored them
literally instead of decoding them.

This fix adds an API PATCH call after PR creation to set the body
with actual newlines. This ensures ${PullRequestDescription} in
SQUASH_TEMPLATE.md contains properly formatted text.

The flow is now:
1. Push with escaped \n in description (to satisfy git)
2. Find the created PR via API
3. PATCH the PR body with actual newlines via API
4. Squash merge uses template with proper formatting
